90/extras/8fbbbf6a16eb1e0fb1f2d8d4e860510e.avif?t=1758849305\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>##A BRAND NEW hand-drawn 32-bit pixel OS designed to remember YOU_</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully explorable interface serves as your path to the digital realm. Drag, click, type, scroll, play games, read files, catch fish, discover desktop pets, send messages, and more! A living operating system is ready to serve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/ce57da925e63efbc7f6dfe070a8cbe4a.poster.avif?t=1758849305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/ce57da925e63efbc7f6dfe070a8cbe4a.webm?t=1758849305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/ce57da925e63efbc7f6dfe070a8cbe4a.mp4?t=1758849305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mirrors OS</strong> is your only gateway into the <i>digital nostalgia</i>\u2122 world system. Ever been bored with plain reality? <i>Digital nostalgia</i>\u2122 lets you explore bizarre places you\u2019ve never visited, meet friends you never knew you needed, and even talk to ghosts. Its deep integration with your machine redefines your interactions with the cyberrealm: everything imaginable is possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mirrors OS</strong>: <i>Rethink the limitations. Reimagine the future.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f4afcb25a44a116db88b7bf68a2f358d.poster.avif?t=1758849305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f4afcb25a44a116db88b7bf68a2f358d.webm?t=1758849305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f4afcb25a44a116db88b7bf68a2f358d.mp4?t=1758849305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/36ebc17ceb223d977f55cf7e64a5a1ef.avif?t=1758849305\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>##Say the right thing and they\u2019ll smile. Tell one lie and they might disappear._</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a whole new world of friends! Bring them little gifts, sit with them while it rains in the corner of their <i>mirrors</i>\u2122. They\u2019ll tell you jokes, send you strange files, and even ask if you\u2019ve eaten today. They\u2019ll try their best for you - and if you don\u2019t like them, you can always find someone new. Here friendship only serves you the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f873f36cb95a87fe54af782c5f585766.apng?t=1758849305\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/f873f36cb95a87fe54af782c5f585766.poster.avif?t=1758849305\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=404 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2ff6fbcab0c989f9af0f6071ec74eaf2.avif?t=1758849305\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>##Old-school games with borderless fun!_</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mirrors OS</strong> offers dozens upon dozens of different games to play with your friends! Maybe you like breaking things? Maybe you enjoy intense shooting? Maybe you\u2019ve always wanted an everlasting pet fish? Or maybe you enjoy building strong defenses with towers? Hold your breath! From now on, your desktop is a web of interconnected games - and you\u2019re stuck in the middle of this never-ending playground. Never stop the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/16accf113d3cc9367e531751d5b2456c.poster.avif?t=1758849305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/16accf113d3cc9367e531751d5b2456c.webm?t=1758849305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/16accf113d3cc9367e531751d5b2456c.mp4?t=1758849305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u25b8 running !SPRKLS.exe \u2736\u2326\u29d7\u22c6</strong></i><strong> [ok]<i>  </i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u25b8 injecting syberia.dll . . . \u2739\u2738\u2737 \u2726</strong></i><strong> [memory leak: ignored]<i>  </i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u25b8 syncing emotional A&gt;C&gt;I&gt;D&gt; memory? . . . \u232b\u2736\u2318\u2736\u232b \u2716\ufe0e </strong></i><strong>[FAILED]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/efc391594baf45c28772f13baab4424a.avif?t=1758849305\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>##Jazz, retrowave, breakcore, post-rock - layered like emotional code, never the same twice._</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>digital nostalgia</i>\u2122 world system provides cutting edge sound-processing software capable of generating the original soundtrack that shifts with the mood of the OS. <i>Lo-fi lullabies for broken apps and lonely ghosts. Jazz by design, distortion by emotion. Heavy breaks with soulful chords.</i> Your life is now a music video - and <strong>YOU are the MAIN HERO.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/0978b3436b75a4a40b21f3d0aac2d53d.poster.avif?t=1758849305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/0978b3436b75a4a40b21f3d0aac2d53d.webm?t=1758849305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/0978b3436b75a4a40b21f3d0aac2d53d.mp4?t=1758849305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/9dc2adfbd076a30c58ba8c6eb35d24f3.poster.avif?t=1758849305\" width=616 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/9dc2adfbd076a30c58ba8c6eb35d24f3.webm?t=1758849305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let it load... \u02d6\u00b0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let it glitch... \u29d7\u232b  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let it speak... \u274d\u274d\u274d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can close the window. \u2326</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you alr